5. **Char-Broil** - If you prioritize power and efficiency, the Char-Broil 4-Burner Gas Grill should make your shortlist. Boasting 32,000 BTUs with an additional 10,000 BTU side burner, this grill ensures quick and even heating for large gatherings (4-6 people). Additionally, its porcelain-coated grates and electronic ignition simplify maintenance tasks, while its sturdy construction promises years of reliable service.
6. **Blackstone** - Last but not least, if you're after a compact yet powerful tabletop griddle, take a closer look at the Blackstone 17\" Tabletop Griddle. Offering 12,000 BTUs through its H-style burner, this griddle delivers even heat distribution for flawless cooking results. Weighing just over 20 pounds, it's easy to transport and store, making it an ideal addition to any outdoor kitchen. Whether you're tailgating or camping, this griddle will become your new best friend!

There you have it – six fantastic options covering every base and catering to different needs and preferences. Happy shopping!</s>

